# HCD-Meta
This repository provides a dataset of short videos about homogeneous content.
![image](https://github.com/BJUT-AIVBD/hcd-meta/blob/main/Fig1.png)

## Introduction
Specifically designed for homogenization recognition, the self-built HCD-Meta covers a wide range of video topics with metadata.

## Download the dataset
The way to download the dataset and the examples of short vides are stored in the "homogeneous_content_dataset".

## Cite this repository
If you use this software in your work, please cite it using the following metadata.
Jiacheng Yao, Jing Zhang, Ze Li, and Li Zhuo. (2023). HCD-Meta by BJUT-AI&VBD [Computer software]. https://github.com/BJUT-AIVBD/hcd-meta

